// BYPASS CLASS B8 -- `kryos build --cache` consulted the artifact cache BEFORE
// the capability checker, and the cache key (source hash, target, mode, output
// type, compiler version) did not include the capability mode. So:
//   1. `kryos build x.kry`                                        -> rejected, E0505
//   2. `kryos build --capabilities-mode=permissive --cache x.kry` -> built, cached
//   3. `kryos build --cache x.kry` (default mode)                 -> cache hit, built
//      (`--strict-capabilities --cache` and KRYOS_CACHE=1 hit the same entry)
// Step 3 is the same source step 1 rejected. On 2026-11-01 master (dcf72e93):
// rc 1, 0, 0.
//
// Pinned by tests/bypass_gate.sh section 8 (with KRYOS_CACHE_DIR in a scratch
// directory): after the fix step 3 is rejected with E0505 and writes nothing.
fn main() {
    println("home=" + env_get("PATH"))
}
